};
---
<Base
  title="CDJ-1500X: sem NTFS, OneLibrary e portas USB | Save My Gig"
  description="Manual de campo do CDJ-1500X: por que ele recusa drives NTFS, a exigência de OneLibrary do rekordbox 7.2.16, e quais portas USB leem um pen drive."
  path="/knowledge/pioneer-dj/cdj-1500x"
  crumbName="CDJ-1500X"
  lang="pt"
>
